# Dependencies

Every installed runtime dependency must have a concrete use in the project. Do not add a package for a feature that is not being built.

If knip reports a package as unused after the work that needed it, remove the package.

Install these only when that feature is actually required: gsap, lenis, react-pdf, react-markdown, remark-gfm, rehype-slug, rehype-autolink-headings, posthog-js, posthog-node, resend, react-map-gl, mapbox-gl.
